<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He walks with me each day;</l><l>I open up to Him;</l><l>He is my life, my stay,</l><l>And everything I need.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>And sometimes when I fail,</l><l>I forget that He’s there;</l><l>He’s just waiting, watching,</l><l>Then He draws me near.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
